00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:18.410
And yet milady stays at home...

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:22.060
Maybe she doesn't have any friends!

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:28.290
A maid must provide her mistress 
with a healthy and happy life.

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:30.040
<b>Sender: Kamoi
Subject: Thank you
The first day ended well. 
I got to talk to milady quite a bit 
and she seemed to enjoy the food I made for her. 
I think I can get even closer to her tomorrow!

00:20:33.100 --> 00:20:34.250
I'm home!

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:37.240
Oh, Misha.

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:39.170
You got along with the maid, I hear.

00:20:39.940 --> 00:20:40.630
What?

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:44.140
It was terrible.

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:46.640
I hate her.

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:49.890
I hope she doesn't come tomorrow.

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:51.440
<i>Huh?</i>

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:53.520
<i>That's completely different from the email.</i>

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:54.900
<i>But...</i>

00:20:55.430 --> 00:21:00.030
<i>I think this maid isn't going 
to get chased off by Misha.</i>

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:02.030
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:21:02.300 --> 00:21:04.530
That's how you dressed today?

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:13.160
<b>2-3
Kamoi</b>

00:21:04.850 --> 00:21:09.150
Yes. The neighbors looked 
at me as if I was garbage.

00:21:09.150 --> 00:21:10.890
Yes, they would.

00:21:10.890 --> 00:21:13.160
But this is for milady.

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:18.090
She needs friends her own age.

00:21:18.480 --> 00:21:21.920
Yeah, but you didn't have to 
come here dressed like that.

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:23.800
Wait. Friends her age?

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:26.660
It's important to look the part first!

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:28.810
In any event, excuse me.

00:21:28.810 --> 00:21:31.600
Mi-i-sha-chan!

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:33.970
Let's play!

00:21:33.970 --> 00:21:35.160
Stay away!

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:37.580
Don't be so stubborn.

00:21:39.060 --> 00:21:40.600
She busted the door down!

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:41.940
I'll fix it later!

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:44.450
<i>You can do it, Misha.</i>

00:21:44.850 --> 00:21:47.570
S-S-Stay away, dummy!

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:49.390
Don't be like that.

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:50.420
Leave!

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:51.450
Be gone!

00:21:52.550 --> 00:21:56.880
Now, let's learn more about each other.

00:21:56.880 --> 00:22:00.300
I don't want to know anything about you!

00:22:00.600 --> 00:22:02.150
Ugh!

00:22:02.980 --> 00:22:07.820
This dumb maid is so annoying!
